    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2603.05273v1</id>
    <title>On Solving String Equations via Powers and Parikh Images</title>
    <updated>2026-03-05T15:21:37Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.05273v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2603.05273v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We present a new approach for solving string equations as extensions of Nielsen transformations. Key to our work are the combination of three techniques: a power operator for strings; generalisations of Parikh images; and equality decomposition. Using these methods allows us to solve complex string equations, including less commonly encountered SMT inputs over strings.</summary>
    <category term="cs.LO" scheme="http://arxiv.org/schemas/atom"/>
    <published>2026-03-05T15:21:37Z</published>
    <arxiv:primary_category term="cs.LO"/>
